+<!doctype html>
+<!-- SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Jandira Technologies, LLC -->
+<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only -->
+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Jubarte — local document preview</title></head>
+<body><main>
+<h1>Your Word document. A reviewable result.</h1>
+<p>Render a DOCX or compare two versions. Document contents stay in your browser.</p>
+<p>This preview uses Jubarte 0.9.2. Start with documents under 16 MiB; large or complex documents can take longer.</p>
+<form id="task">
+<label>Original DOCX <input id="original" type="file" accept=".docx" required></label>
+<label>Modified DOCX, for comparison <input id="modified" type="file" accept=".docx"></label>
+<label>Revision author <input id="author" value="Reviewer" maxlength="128"></label>
+<div><button id="render" type="submit" value="render">Render a PDF</button><button id="compare" type="submit" value="compare">Compare versions</button><button id="cancel" type="button" disabled>Cancel</button></div>
+</form>
+<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready. Choose a document to begin.</p>
+<div id="downloads"></div>
+<iframe id="preview" title="Generated PDF preview" hidden></iframe>
+<section><h2>Use it in your project</h2><p>Install: <code>pip install jubarte-redlines</code> or <code>npm install jubarte-wasm</code></p><pre id="recipe">Choose a task to see its code.</pre></section>
+<p>No analytics or document upload are included. The static application and its WASM module are downloaded from this host.</p>
+</main><script type="module" src="/src/main.js"></script></body></html>
diff --git a/examples/playground/src/main.js b/examples/playground/src/main.js
new file mode 100644
